    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Odometer verification against the LR bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The odometer reading is recorded and cross‑checked with the mileage on the Lorry Receipt. Matching figures confirm the vehicle was not driven beyond the authorized distance. Any discrepancy over 5 km is noted and explained.</p>
