    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Scanned copies of the signed handover, the daylight inspection photos, and the LR bilty are uploaded to the central logistics portal within 24 hours. This creates an immutable audit trail that can be referenced in case of future warranty claims or disputes.</p>
