      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transporting a motorcycle from Pune to Kolhapur (≈ 260 km) demands a solution that shields the bike from highway debris, rain, dust, and potential vandalism. Two popular options are enclosed containerized carriers and open trailers, each with distinct advantages and drawbacks.</p>

